Substantive modifications in this derivative work include:
- Netgear Nighthawk Genie SOAP southbound adapter (RS700/RS700S), bounded
  client/state caching, and honest rejection of unsupported Omada SET intents;
- Conservative tri-band EAP770/EAP773 negotiation profiles and Omada 6.3
  inform wire-contract compatibility;
- Optional certificate-pinned stock HTTPS dashboard telemetry reader;
- Optional passive 802.11 BSS Load beacon observer and dedicated switch-port
  uplink octet observer;
- Per-device atomic session heartbeats, CLI --healthcheck probe, and OCI
  container packaging.

